  "label_mapping_rule": "For card index c=0..4 and zero-based question index j=0..7, canonical option dN maps to opaque key k(1+(N+c+j) mod option_count). Baseline insertion is the canonical option list rotated left by (c+2*j) mod option_count. O reverses that baseline insertion only, retaining every key-description association and question order. No card id, role, condition, evaluator key or source filenames enter model state. Each R uses the exact serialized U request bytes including the same asset identifier.",
